  aciklama:
  - "Fincan\u0131n\u0131n alt k\u0131s\u0131mlar\u0131ndaki baz\u0131 telveler, dalgal\u0131
    bir denizi and\u0131r\u0131yor. Bu dalgalar, \xF6zel hayat\u0131ndaki \"bir anda
    co\u015Fan ve \xE7abuk durulan\" ruh halini yans\u0131t\u0131yor {{isim}}. Son
    zamanlarda \xE7ok h\u0131zl\u0131 duygu de\u011Fi\u015Fimleri ve sevin\xE7ten
    h\xFCzne ge\xE7i\u015Fler ya\u015F\u0131yor olmal\u0131s\u0131n. Sorun ise hislerin
    de\u011Fil, i\xE7indekileri kar\u015F\u0131ndaki insanlara gere\u011Finden fazla
    aksettirmen. A\u015Fkta galibiyet i\xE7in, stabilite \u015Fartt\u0131r. Usta
    y\xF6netmen Nuri Bilge Ceylan'\u0131n da dedi\u011Fi gibi; \"baz\u0131 insanlar
    g\xFCl\xFC\u015F\xFCyle yener sizi. Her \u015Fey s\xF6z de\u011Fil; tav\u0131r.\"
    Eylemlerini kontrol alt\u0131na ald\u0131\u011F\u0131nda, sonu\xE7lar\u0131 da
    g\xFCzel olacakt\u0131r."
